MACRO P                                                                         
 &P.WBDC-AREA                                       W         5 A               
*                                 LINK AREA TO PGM WL10WBDC.                    
*                                 IT RETURNS INFO ABOUT A DC                    
*                                 - DOES IT USE PULS WEB?                       
*                                 - WHICH MANAGMENT FOLLOW-UP                   
*                                   GROUP DOES IT BELONG TO?                    
*                                 INPUT ARGUMEN:                                
*                                  IDDC         THE DC                          
*                                 OUTPUT ARGUMENTS:                             
*                                  FLWEBDC      YES IF WEB DC                   
*                                  KDMFUP       OUTPUT MSG TEXT                 
     &P.WBDC-IDDC &P.WBDC-AREA                                2 A               
*                                 IDENTIFIERARE LAGER                           
*                                 WAREHOUSE IDENTIFIER                          
     &P.WBDC-FLWEBDC &P.WBDC-AREA                       +2    1 A               
*                                 DC MED WEB GRÄNSSNITT                         
*                                 DC WITH WEB INTERFACE                         
     &P.WBDC-KDMFUP &P.WBDC-AREA                        +3    2 A               
*                                 RAPPORTGRUPP  MA/CN/PF/NA                     
*                                 REPORT GROUP  MA/CN/PF/NA                     
*** END COPY                             LENGTH =             5                 
